Node ID=02 the plot
Text=So the little spy has ears after all. Very well: the other human town, the one down the valley with the walls and the priests in it. We could take it between sunrise and noon and be eating its sheep by dark. Instead we sit in a ruin because an oracle told Menoetius to wait for a fleshling, and here you stand, and I am not impressed.
Should Have Voiceover=0

