------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=03 patience
Text=Klao says patience. Lethos says patience. Rhea says a great deal about chains and nothing about what we do when the chain is hungry. I say a tribe that waits on the word of a cave-dwelling oracle and a runt in boots has already begun to forget what it is. Ask me again when Memnos is dealt with.
Should Have Voiceover=0

